# Build context for .github/docker/*.Dockerfile is the repository root (the images copy
# .github/docker/ci-requirements.txt and tests/smoke/requirements.txt). Neither needs the
# history, the agent worktrees, or any local virtualenv — sending them would make every
# image build upload hundreds of megabytes it then ignores.
.git
.claude/worktrees
.grok/worktrees
.venv
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
*.pkg
*.qcow2
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
id_rsa
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.pub
*.pem
.gh-token
smoke_key
